{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52650","headline":"同[前] · 冯□原","name":"同[前]","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（上缺）如。\n淮南桂□林，幽□武城隅。\n□白无人识，□□□杨殊。\n影□岩□□，□□□□□。\n𠭴公子至，香拂舞童□\n不被王孙□，何由得鉴欤？\n□转□□□，□□□□□。\n（同前）（按：以下诸诗，皆署〖同前〗，知爲同时唱和之作。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯□原","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}